# ---------- working files that stay on this computer ----------
# Raw images kept in the project root: the optimized versions the site uses live in /public.
/*.png
/*.jpg
/*.jpeg
/*.webp
# The CV served by the site is /public/CV_Moch_Toriq_Hisam.pdf; this ignores the loose copy in the root.
/CV_*.pdf
# Notes, specs and checklists written while building the site (they mention reference sites and
# unfinished cleanup items, so they are not meant for a public repo). Delete a line to publish that file.
/CLAUDE.md
/PORTFOLIO_REQUIREMENTS.md
/design.md
/page-transition.md
/cursor-spec.md
/skills-page-spec.md
